# Compiled binaries from `go build ./cmd/<name>/...` land here (this
# directory), named after <name> - go run avoids this, but a plain
# build during ad-hoc verification can leave one behind. Throwaway
# verification programs under cmd/ are deleted after use per
# docs/RUNBOOKS.md's bootstrap pattern; this backstops a compiled
# artifact outliving that cleanup. Add new names here if they recur.
/pulselivecheck
/pulselivecheck2
/presencecheck
/bondracecheck
/resyncadmin
